{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hollowglass</strong> - Atmospheric first-person horror about the last minutes of survival in the desert, despite all its dangers.<br><br>Try to survive at least one more moment. The source of water is already very close, do not be <strong>afraid of jackals</strong>, do not be <strong>afraid of vultures</strong>, do not be <strong>afraid of pain</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547580/extras/ae368b8fa97cb25be4eae5252a0b9921.poster.avif?t=1748475401\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547580/extras/ae368b8fa97cb25be4eae5252a0b9921.webm?t=1748475401\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547580/extras/ae368b8fa97cb25be4eae5252a0b9921.mp4?t=1748475401\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do not <strong>listen to the voice</strong>, do not <strong>slow down</strong>, hold on to the stick as if it were the last thing left of you. The source of water is already very close, do not be <strong>afraid of death</strong>, do not be <strong>afraid of snakes</strong>, do not be <strong>afraid of the desert</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547580/extras/4cf3158199c9039e33ecca90e9bd2b7b.poster.avif?t=1748475401\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547580/extras/4cf3158199c9039e33ecca90e9bd2b7b.webm?t=1748475401\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547580/extras/4cf3158199c9039e33ecca90e9bd2b7b.mp4?t=1748475401\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do not <strong>listen to yourself</strong>, you know the direction, do not stumble and keep moving even when there is nothing left to move with. The source of water is already very close, do not be <strong>afraid of emptiness</strong>, do not be <strong>afraid of it</strong>, do not be <strong>afraid</strong>...<br><br>Features: <br>- Graphics stylized as PS1 <br>- Various dangers <br>- Well-developed artificial intelligence of jackals</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First Sip","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3547580/c8088fe2d42e70941efc545fe55b9a88f39b4345.jpg"},{"name":"Where\u2019s the New One?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3547580/767b45e6c6910d1918ded5edbe59a244830b6f43.jpg"},{"name":"Dream Crushed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3547580/44c0dfdc63a4847c6225bbb82f299fd98880acc1.jpg"},{"name":"They Come","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3547580/11d836af6c1940ccc4a87858d28ca9cb193a613a.jpg"},{"name":"Purity","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3547580/06d6c4090a97c2eb4d00700ba30677f269b1a447.jpg"},{"name":"Just a Nibble!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3547580/b10732d2c9dc8d7f0d14c5ec80f5fdf9769d4665.jpg"},{"name":"Is It Poisonous?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3547580/471d5fd705b7b0ecfbb75fd5b420eeba0a8072d8.jpg"},{"name":"Top Gone","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3547580/8038de68b03ab2f50723fcb162c9620b32aa5b46.jpg"},{"name":"They Whisper","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3547580/37ffb02fe2bd0